info.description:
Socket.IO WebSocket collection for all group chat events.

Connection: ws://localhost:3000?userId={{userId}}

Each request documents the event name to emit, the payload, and the expected server response events.

request.description:
Add a new member to the group. Only admin can add.

**Emit Event:** `add-group-member`

**Payload:**
```json
{
  "groupChatRoomId": "{{groupChatRoomId}}",
  "newMemberId": "{{targetMemberId}}"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| groupChatRoomId | string | ✅ | Target group ID |
| newMemberId | string | ✅ | User ID to add |

**Response Events:**

1. `group-member-added` → to all group members:
```json
{
  "message": "<nick_name> was added to the group",
  "newMember": {
    "id": "membership-id",
    "user_id": "new-member-id",
    "group_role": "GROUP_MEMBER",
    "user": {
      "id": "new-member-id",
      "nick_name": "Jane",
      "avatar": "avatar-url"
    }
  },
  "groupChatRoomId": "group-id"
}
```

2. `success` → to the new member:
```json
{
  "message": "You've been added to a group",
  "groupChatRoomId": "group-id",
  "newMember": { ... }
}
```

3. `success` → to requester:
```json
{
  "message": "Member added successfully",
  "newMember": { ... }
}
```

Fetch all group chat rooms the user belongs to. Also auto-joins all group Socket.IO rooms.

**Emit Event:** `fetch-group-chat-rooms`

**Payload:**
```json
{
  "page": 1,
  "limit": 10
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|-------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
| page | number | ❌ | 1 | Page number |
| limit | number | ❌ | 10 | Items per page |

**Response Event:** `group-chat-rooms`
```json
{
  "rooms": [
    {
      "id": "group-id",
      "name": "My Group",
      "image": "image-url",
      "group_members_count": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-05-06T03:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T03:00:00.000Z",
      "members": [
        {
          "id": "membership-id",
          "user_id": "user-id",
          "group_role": "GROUP_ADMIN",
          "user": {
            "id": "user-id",
            "nick_name": "John",
            "avatar": "avatar-url"
          }
        }
      ],
      "chats": [
        {
          "id": "message-id",
          "message": "Last message",
          "createdAt": "2026-05-06T03:00:00.000Z",
          "sender": {
            "id": "user-id",
            "nick_name": "John"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "total": 3
}
```
